{"job_id":"F-b60f7d5304d8bc66159f","family_id":"F-b60f7d5304d8bc66159f","title":"한국지방행정연구원 육성법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":13,"target_id":"c463ad1e5cc8766bb50971a0ab5aca17b519a6623bc9d1d825301d00056daa98","source_hash":"266a2bdae2210d653a7a8c43ac03ac3dc35ba5a2364e56ea6bdb17df18a001b2","text":"韩国地方行政研究所促进法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":129,"target_id":"690f7c9c10e7bd3c971bf859b0f286339fcf3df971aa7de36ab74413852b2d28","source_hash":"20741f40412064e9ed2ffd3087751b6ebd4b08ea583ab7d80284bfdd95ba1e22","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过保护和促进韩国地方行政研究院的发展，为地方自治的发展做出贡献。韩国地方行政研究院是为全面、系统地开展地方行政、财政、税收以及区域发展所必需的研究和调查而设立的基金会。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":129,"end":297,"target_id":"648544fd1ebcf745df403e2968554eb46ba0423dc4378d5f8e41a5fe016b0ae7","source_hash":"7dd6c35d7fc89c1ebda90b33704ddcf386764f4b073f18282677f18137528b44","text":"第2条（基金）\n① 在韩国地方行政研究院（以下简称“研究院”）设立专项基金，用于支付研究院的设施和运营所需资金。\n② 第1款所述基金应当通过地方政府和其他实体的捐款设立。\n③ 第1款所述基金的运作和管理所需事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":297,"end":531,"target_id":"6e2c0678f79bde281cbd96542f968eb4f9453069bf65244c7cb8025dfdf00d24","source_hash":"6c9cb2efefc6c75b26adbb7b5576f202365321b7899b2d4752444647515b6d62","text":"文章 3（贡献）\n① 该研究所的运营资金来自国家和地方政府的拨款以及其他收入。\n② 国家应在预算范围内提供必要的拨款，以支付研究所的设施和运营费用。\n③ 地方政府应当在预算范围内提供资金，用于支付研究所的设施和运营费用以及第二条规定的基金。\n④ 根据第2款和第3款规定，有关缴款、使用和管理等事宜，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":531,"end":713,"target_id":"4103fc0f87187dedf1f5ceeb77786615c4ef10d5e5c07c8440fc90ea4f55e71f","source_hash":"5969957ba33314db153f5a422788ab69d3461ff959af5845a30112ac351547ef","text":"第四条（国有和公共财产的租赁等）为研究所的设施和运作需要，国家或者地方政府可以按照《国家财产法》或者《公共财产和物资管理法》的规定，将国有或者公共财产租赁给研究所；对于公共财产，即使《公共财产和物资管理法》另有规定，也可以无偿转让。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":713,"end":1016,"target_id":"256541cb6c77851a334067b819912df568b67b630c16b595312dd066b3ea448f","source_hash":"35a66711b0c5acc2f733986c7dc93ed3183a2a984d7b9f5b36daa400053a3b11","text":"第五条（研究调查委托和数据提供）\n① 国家或者地方政府要委托进行与地方自治有关的研究或调查的，应当优先委托给某个研究机构，而不是其他研究机构，但法律另有规定或者有特殊情况的除外。\n② 研究人员可以向国家、地方政府或国家及公共教育或研究机构申请获取与地方自治相关的出版物或其他资料。在这种情况下，除非有特殊原因，否则收到申请的机构应当提供。\n③ 根据第 2 款提供给研究所的出版物或其他材料不得用于研究以外的用途。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1016,"end":1152,"target_id":"2f581d10d4ac4a71837da4d16272fc5d62c1236b2996a4c78bc04086291cde87","source_hash":"f349c8f7b50bd7eacd6ac57af32f167ea4c76351ee7a096c26e7bef5de68260c","text":"第六条（业务计划等的审批）研究所应当编制每个财政年度的业务计划和预算，提交内政安全部长审批。如需修改，亦应遵循此规定。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1152,"end":1283,"target_id":"8550ca439439cf564a4a650d65beef5edcfe81351c89099cce76b557566391ad","source_hash":"12e0fe3c28807a6238845766e095aa8b94771a59a0411dfa5402971fd96b48e0","text":"第七条（结算报表的提交）研究所应编制每个财政年度的收支报表，并由内政安全部长指定的注册会计师进行审计，然后提交内政安全部长。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1283,"end":1417,"target_id":"f6485b51fbd16f7a5b8c78a6618e0daab37c113f322b2558bd0192a9a84b99a6","source_hash":"20b58cf360b1ba69a9749002a4c31455c087adce3ce4c2fcf4f341cf87704db7","text":"第八条（报告、检查等）  为进行监督，内政安全部长可要求研究所报告其运作情况，或指派其管辖范围内的官员检查其运作情况。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1417,"end":1501,"target_id":"f4ccd340b09c4508e8afb0a66d51bdb5d158d9cbee2710fdac8dd98bcf45ce33","source_hash":"1cca7886f6a15a809e801acd3a442be916d310a556ab4cb37442fc03193da5f8","text":"第九条（保密义务）  研究所的管理人员、雇员或前任管理人员不得泄露或挪用在履行职责过程中获悉的秘密。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1501,"end":1556,"target_id":"0646ac0a604a971880e76cfb18e81918a60da3488d882caa2b91a61ee359a54f","source_hash":"74305cd25befbb4ea2a57b28712c2173a71d3fe85ab03d2b647cb822cb9185e9","text":"第十条（处罚） 违反第九条的，处两年以下有期徒刑或者200万韩元以下罚金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1556,"end":1576,"target_id":"58444261c971572faaa9e7f85d1280e8aa8d2e49a5af7901f981c1242c4058b3","source_hash":"c7bef9520a9f148e2a09590d177ed244d264b002fbb38e28e36c261a647bec86","text":"删除第 11 条 <2011.3.8>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1576,"end":1677,"target_id":"523f1e640db76313ea4095b6055c5776377da38ab16f3b26713e6d671a31419f","source_hash":"a984a6a809e6799fc56e2c83f13a2d9f5baf936a8e0054372ad020ff2af4280b","text":"补充规定 <1986年5月8日第3809号>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（关于资金的过渡措施）本法实施时研究所的资金应视为本法项下的资金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1677,"end":1720,"target_id":"be7020c93a2efa4546712ccd55a0bbb71245aadb7ceee6683eaa4f352e47262c","source_hash":"80906563fa664b7fd4d40ecf90deffe30f3cc515b6be4fb97cb9f6bf0b9bffc7","text":"补充规定 <第7910号，2006年3月24日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1720,"end":1750,"target_id":"6a49d2e1e0d0fe897dbf3968e86f1b9913b12e0df1a6a0865e1189d8919f7831","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1750,"end":1882,"target_id":"3784af0f7f44262634085ae935fb9a6dc9870a772d070301898b93c1b56246c5","source_hash":"8a2507cda73de4f24375f33bb9ca2d174b5c3ec8338e1c6a148d9d12adc3b275","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1882,"end":1899,"target_id":"16f5d9765990d0a6b30654836708b9fdc079e1e85a997b1a610ecc6c82e6c0db","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1899,"end":2044,"target_id":"693c3e4cda474e50cb9b08c900ab0d4c2584305159f6008166bc5a18a6ec55e7","source_hash":"3b2701e902153163c57c3bbaccf4f0c1d895054e0489e5e45484c90c430e204d","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 至<236> 已删除\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第六条至第八条中，“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“公共行政和安全部长”。\n\n  <238> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2044,"end":2052,"target_id":"de9a316cfba4fcb496b005bb46a52dfb6227bd2e5bf0b7b4289290a746518327","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2052,"end":2130,"target_id":"fe5a9097d783a1da2eb4f73a7fd789a5433cc1ee907872da2e2daacebd531a2c","source_hash":"53de4d6253f9d567618a38f9a5569d5b5b0e7177d1044a3f9e5ad829607223e7","text":"补充规定 <第10440号，2011年3月8日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。但第四条的修正规定自2012年1月1日起适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2130,"end":2161,"target_id":"70ddd5829c937d0042255368ee39c2712c8d80854ebfb1e2437772104264ec99","source_hash":"884b1766aaddfed62f208e70764e5d43694b510475476512e06be6a0808c47af","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第11690号法案，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2161,"end":2200,"target_id":"b9d4dd36833c537781091f0ec861c78ea1fd20c0bf66016be9b232269408ee51","source_hash":"11264c491a84d09dc371820c68fae870846004c0353283ed56de4b9c8d25c060","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n  ② 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2200,"end":2217,"target_id":"c10d19bff06afc232d54cf4f9c07cac618e59f7a584f220a1b51375b7f907ec0","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2217,"end":2288,"target_id":"c480f4d0a4848b2a0d01dec2cb5693c40272f8f6ee38c64cae45ec1f7a79fef5","source_hash":"f874bbb3dfdb08e1acc7e02bdaa81dd6aa1cf4cf04ed8b078ada7c7e8d94ab9d","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<213>条已省略\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2288,"end":2363,"target_id":"52f0d8b1965680ce229177bf6c4c90136f27f9f4066e99fef22e0092a40df952","source_hash":"bf3bb5604e4cc3ccd8154f7f5797bfc6619b430d9e99fa55543e66d54e336cc7","text":"  第六条第一款、第七条和第八条中的“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全保障部长”。\n\n  <215> 至 <710> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2363,"end":2371,"target_id":"6214749e2803d0af6fd4725c4259a4b2b31ff59c06f6e2c3c4bfdf101b1b7acb","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2371,"end":2403,"target_id":"90ada3598f87f8b515df5fc687e444afbb204d7daf5889985cec6671418585cb","source_hash":"a519f970907d80fc108d8947e92031f10c4d0762155b909dfe5d01543374cb67","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第12844号法令，2014年11月19日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2403,"end":2522,"target_id":"4c53db836932eac9a89e71fd7ba4df005ce22f2ea0382c48c0fb340104f66272","source_hash":"bb485e539c649e8835d14e3b1b139feba527f204c8e9fced9e458cc082dde578","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第六条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的条款，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2522,"end":2539,"target_id":"2c9011509a192850a6591b668f42397af91b3d79f3db51bc6e14a4a42b8326db","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2539,"end":2610,"target_id":"26c681cb1def324b8ffd0860c7720a98c43842e8501a2df04a02f0e9ee18b314","source_hash":"97552e3d2f04d3839b4496d4dad48ef4e19a4b31e0f97fbe940ae3c12c16f2db","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<120>款已省略\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2610,"end":2685,"target_id":"9fa5062acd534348120110bd97b2c3d088d6f85b4c24272386b22614a3b97901","source_hash":"3091a2eac4816918a7094d55a1001e775bd0842fcfb5e3cbae4348b9636bf8ea","text":"  第六条第一款、第七条和第八条中的“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <122> 至 <258> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2685,"end":2693,"target_id":"559ee4c1296b26b5283aa99987ac561e100c4d6f3ca0649673ef3dcd582efc30","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2693,"end":2724,"target_id":"34b581c6e144928d3883102973082b8b1d57d87def4b45211fdf17077bb39cf3","source_hash":"89d73ef846bf6ff580dd06ac1dbeb869ec8e8f9d99295a602fcc49a474c5bde9","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第14839号法令，2017年7月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2724,"end":2845,"target_id":"fc1a7e581e8324c2aaec805db851429d927b636ee12e90ba205b5333dd831a0c","source_hash":"e7f048bc4b0ef4b04a065b53430b00744940cecd919f925823a150f1c549efd1","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第五条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的部分，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2845,"end":2862,"target_id":"2793b99f133840b7f135811668158c3ea286823b14af0a5db8cbf5cfe1dea41a","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2862,"end":3002,"target_id":"3917f9bcb5b079fe6443f40bc10c9a95289a0d3b3b94c72101f31bb925e73265","source_hash":"e174884f476a17d582aefbc28e7c619dcb86c6659839d35a2772c833298d598c","text":"第五条（其他法律的修正）①至<106>款已省略\n\n  <107> 《韩国地方行政研究所促进法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条至第八条中，“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“公共行政和安全部长”。\n\n  <108> 至 <382> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001107-195120-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3002,"end":3008,"target_id":"76bbc047958849269d4e1e423522fec3202b60b8b06b81e2892446f4b8235601","source_hash":"0ce5e24c4dce9d4ec9f13e0c399e3542af4b8a8c383f999fb1c0116c332a9c5d","text":"第6条省略"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":17,"target_id":"8178f927f37b8185f3cc1d42ac3a062a675891ed01be2db0741da0955e1ebd09","source_hash":"cd28e8df152953844f72e44e0e113309e770ef7fd3258eaac9d3d3c4128d490a","text":"《促进韩国地方行政研究院法》实施细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":101,"target_id":"815174ac5dd340abec2445e24718d283dac42f7c0801e3950adc4156dcd0267e","source_hash":"fbb4a596f5bd786da20b020de22a25616ba8910345ff16002336cb934dba865b","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定《韩国地方行政研究院振兴法》（以下简称“该法”）所委托的事项以及为实施该法所必需的事项。<2015年10月29日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":101,"end":449,"target_id":"f6958c2917be2637985d56483317450846030a864e72cd72b3bd482b175b7e1d","source_hash":"12a53121f217588db80d81bb40bb1bc036c56de319522da0e6a6cb3aaeb42ab1","text":"第二条（基金的运作和管理）\n① 韩国地方行政研究院（以下简称“研究院”）应设立并管理一个单独的账户，用于存放通过捐款产生的资金。\n② 研究机构拟减少基金本金时，须经内政安全部长批准。<2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2017年7月26日修订>\n③ 该基金不得用于研究所的设施和运营以外的任何目的。\n④ 研究机构应制定基金运作和管理的具体规章，并取得内政安全部长的批准。如需修改该等规章，亦应遵循相同程序。<2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":449,"end":881,"target_id":"66546c010f18bd62fb7e6d7ad683e648f62999e56018653f42020761c6c115c0","source_hash":"80caf57e4e96880111b2aa52a66509a161645da63d46df79f68ae34fbe242974","text":"第三条（缴款等的程序）\n① 研究机构应于每年10月31日前，向特别市、广域市、特别自治市市长、省长或特别自治省省长（以下简称“市/省长”）提交下一财政年度的拨款申请，并附上下列各款所列文件，同时应立即向内政安全部部长报告。<2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2015年10月29日；2017年7月26日；2021年1月5日修订>\n1. 下一财年业务计划\n2. 下一财政年度的预计财务状况表和预计损益表\n3. 澄清其他预算详情所需文件\n② 当捐款预算最终确定后，市长或省长应通知研究所。\n③ 研究机构如欲获得根据第2款规定确认和通知的拨款，应当向市长或省长提交拨款申请，并附上资金执行计划。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":881,"end":1144,"target_id":"7fd09eb1df196a0ff5e52d8762dc191a86993e43dc472e85faf12ccce857621a","source_hash":"564d6ba13bce4bfb409c4f5c549859876abd269fe3d80272869f5474e3bd92fd","text":"第四条（商业计划和预算的批准）\n① 根据本法第6条的规定，研究所应当在每个财政年度开始前至少一个月向内政安全大臣提交项目计划和预算，并获得批准。<2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2017年7月26日修订>\n② 研究机构依据第1款规定获得内政安全部长批准后，应当立即将详情报市长或省长。<2008年2月29日、2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1144,"end":1255,"target_id":"25a041064b0381306925983c060a4ef0788f1c5571ab80899d42302f12c986f0","source_hash":"fbfc62fc2cae169b8700bb297b4658e6de52e8df01df5f17d37bbde97703c556","text":"第五条（盈余处理）研究所应当利用每个财政年度的盈余，首先弥补上一财政年度结转的亏损，如有剩余，则转入下一财政年度的收入或转入基金。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1255,"end":1487,"target_id":"c36b88a874079ff29c1fda0c206ce4d9231758453d6dea5c62c9f506dd1044ce","source_hash":"3b542c8cb5b80f7ceb65d9fe814aff4d42bea65df950f0fe54026fd41448991d","text":"第六条（结算报表的提交）研究所应按照本法第七条的规定，在每个财政年度结束后两个月内，向内政安全部长提交该财政年度的收支报表，并附上下列各款规定的文件。<2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2017年7月26日；2021年1月5日修订>\n1. 资产负债表和利润表\n2. 本年度业务计划及执行绩效对比表\n3. 注册会计师根据《会计师法》第7条规定出具的意见\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1487,"end":1532,"target_id":"3d97fb2026337ff63aa299ec41482b39ebe4307b3c4c8a7c8c2ad4bbc4807143","source_hash":"a1bf3a4a1ab3479d892c70e44f784981af9e6e7e15c326de313063b1f027b34b","text":"补充规定 <第11961号，1986年9月11日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1532,"end":1574,"target_id":"b89c3452ac2d6da0ca4fef244ecfa27095cae7136d8a3eb81c0dc8fe5cde5f2a","source_hash":"044e85cd01389ab8ecb6cca7abc7cbb6c18ecb4cba15c33e90724344aa05b2a2","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20741号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1574,"end":1611,"target_id":"ba86a13f47e1ef013fd496b27c456fe81ee4c5b08b859f839395ee4fff5d1f2c","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1611,"end":1628,"target_id":"9ead55c714dd57630c2276a44e554c3a2e3e1a322da8b03906768d6225d4651b","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1628,"end":1819,"target_id":"30133a5d3d8190908cfd69fd93a2406daf2278323ad368f9b3e532edb24c617e","source_hash":"e8b2b9de52f87514f171ac5929b072c096d4e6e5e2eee374c53fe24e45c7f219","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<101> 已省略\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法实施细则》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款和第四款中，除第三条第一款的子款、第四条第一款和第二款以及第六条的子款之外的部分，“内政部长”应改为“公共行政和安全部长”。\n\n  <103> 至 <105> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1819,"end":1861,"target_id":"d9062c8f713e4e285d49b339caaf1e7683719911fd850be66f1a6ee7013a3dbe","source_hash":"875ab8aee4a83235873b291162119cdb344d6ba8382803dc8137e33dcb11d458","text":"增编（安全与公共管理部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24425号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1861,"end":1986,"target_id":"d6f439cbb90867cab41545bf903a8b14f91c160ecc6f8da3759fbcc6caf6d02b","source_hash":"43029911dc2de8ee3c18d3a0db5ea54e4a90b52bf432a54ad38d3946d19ff180","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自该等总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1986,"end":2003,"target_id":"240ca322cc8f3db11c195e286943f81c22f3bd3120a612d1c3827a90d3f8cdab","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2003,"end":2199,"target_id":"3e0407f0ebcccc70d6f3049975e641afffcfd2eb949dfd034d9d5f1a3490d91d","source_hash":"95dc16d0fac020f2b66595991eccf33998cc80d054f6c4ba2c2bfd09bb4ec5e5","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<123>款已省略\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法实施细则》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款；该条第四款第一部分；第三条第一款除编号项目以外的部分；第四条第一款和第二款；以及第六条除编号项目以外的部分，“公共行政和安全部长”均应改为“安全部长”。\n\n  <125> 至 <129> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2199,"end":2242,"target_id":"7f364ede30763b43324428d561b8cac0bcde6e808f69355cba025cfe5b59c699","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"增编（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2242,"end":2367,"target_id":"95db9e8c634628a24a915d99590a313337a0f95fa01d5555d3abb581244f92d7","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2367,"end":2384,"target_id":"48c6043863b392aa5ee464a8cc0226501827f46d4ed20f0d8308a8e592a9cdad","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第2至4条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2384,"end":2580,"target_id":"c2864f35df061d0aa91dfc3b41b18b2eb5aee029c9d2797dccd7aaa160108186","source_hash":"3143a49da455c58dff3f23992f44f324c7b179853f09989e47900e5e8d03e90b","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<239>款已省略\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法实施细则》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款；该条第四款第一部分；第三条第一款除编号项目以外的部分；第四条第一款和第二款；以及第六条除编号项目以外的部分中，“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <241> 至 <418> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2580,"end":2625,"target_id":"ffa77d208697ef4a933f5692f0e6df346a856f692663d6a3e64f82cc93d4134e","source_hash":"fd6ea3d4b99f34f77c5b8fdfcccd7cba526284ed99e9328669ee73d823a10c27","text":"补充规定 <第26610号，2015年10月29日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2625,"end":2667,"target_id":"33f62786c5e485f83a0b6f2d7467f93bebd2e37ba16d4aa4e37e875539c9d625","source_hash":"2229ee61688f381fa8791a317dce02e692966c0fc8dfff0224bc44e3cd9315a8","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2017年7月26日，第28211号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2667,"end":2792,"target_id":"26a730b06941cf45c363f3101af9fc0c709ea445b535f130d44f7ad1bb882308","source_hash":"e322c6bccc7dc02efb62fdad6a23702463436edc72b2f2f5029c536f3946505e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第八条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自该等总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00024","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2792,"end":2809,"target_id":"d0848cbd2d4f82cb86be4f16984a9e2555782ac086bf6c81686dc91d5957c2c6","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第2至7条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00025","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2809,"end":3007,"target_id":"80e01d5d65351a084bf1ad7c5e0f57e2dd43d5c2ee3c603157e7bcc644a42cce","source_hash":"96d3cef2672b266040cd84fc1d87b607448be964cd1e866779a7685d0a16f1b9","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至<196>款已省略\n\n  《韩国地方行政研究所促进法实施细则》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第二款；该条第四款第一部分；第三条第一款除编号项目以外的部分；第四条第一款和第二款；以及第六条除编号项目以外的部分中，“行政和内政部长”均应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n  <198> 至 <388> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00026","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-005479-227985-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3007,"end":3096,"target_id":"f136b8176b42573d62010457c328ecf1b454dcf83553f7b82775d02